    narr:narration """The architectural shift from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline is framed as a settled [migration decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_1). This transition is anchored in [quantified performance and cost justifications](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_2), specifically targeting a 10x improvement in query speed and reduced licensing overhead. The [editorial record](narr:Narrative_TechMigrationJustifiedByPerformanceCost) formalizes these claims into a structured roadmap, [codifying the migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_3), the [expected performance gains](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_4), and a [firm Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_5). The discourse moves from the initial declaration of intent to a standardized, parallelized format that emphasizes both technical competence and organizational commitment.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_TechMigrationJustifiedByPerformanceCost> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Performance gain**: 10x analytical queries" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "While the primary narrative emphasizes technical performance, the timeline entry introduces an element of institutional pressure and authority-ranking not present in the initial declaration." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787390247116_5> ] ;
